(Sheldon:)-That's odd.
-What?

5
00:00:13,033 --> 00:00:15,343
(Sheldon:)There are takeout containers
in the trash can.

6
00:00:15,502 --> 00:00:17,912
(Penny:)So? That's my dinner from last night.

7
00:00:18,072 --> 00:00:21,022
(Sheldon:)What's odd is they're
in the trash can.

8
00:00:21,175 --> 00:00:23,625
(Penny:)Okay. Look, honey,
I promise there's no one's here.

9
00:00:23,777 --> 00:00:26,257
I've had a long day. I just want
to have a quiet dinner by myself.

10
00:00:26,413 --> 00:00:28,693
(Sheldon:)Oh, very well.

11
00:00:28,849 --> 00:00:33,089
(Sheldon:)I'm no stranger to enjoying
the pleasures of solitude.

12
00:00:33,254 --> 00:00:35,534
(Sheldon:)-Oh!
-What?

13
00:00:35,689 --> 00:00:37,469
(Sheldon:)Have you gotten Leonard
a welcome-home gift yet?

14
00:00:37,625 --> 00:00:38,625
(Sheldon:)-No.
-Oh, great.

15
00:00:38,792 --> 00:00:41,702
(Sheldon:)Do you want to go halfsies
on a 200 dollar squirt gun?

16
