(Howard:)I mean, you know
I'm trying to lose weight.

20
00:00:55,643 --> 00:00:58,993
(Howard:)God, I thought we were partners
in this marriage.

21
00:00:59,146 --> 00:01:02,556
(Bernadette:)We are. Stop it. And for the
last time, you're not fat.

